passing the budget under Section 115 (4);
(ix)
fixing or levying of fees under Section 144;
(x)
declaration of a private street as public street under Section 190; and
(xi)
paying compensation under Section 191 (5).

(vi)
Assistant Registrar, Co-operative Societies, exercising jurisdiction in the district or the District Co-operative Officer, as
the case may be;
(vii)
District Livestock Officer;
(viii)
District Industries Officer;
(ix)
District Statistics Officer; and
(x)
